Fresh-database migration baseline for the restored iLab application.

The historical, non-reproducible 2024 revisions are archived in legacy_2024.
The active versions directory contains the new baseline and subsequent changes.

Use: python -m flask --app app:create_app init-db
Do not stamp or upgrade an unidentified historical database into this baseline.
Keep it unchanged, export it, and import records into a separate new database.
